+ *       (= 224 ciphertext + the 32-byte tag at +0xE0)
+ *
+ * Both MACs of this pair verify with the REFERENCE's own key material, which
+ * is what this driver now carries:
+ *   tag      = HMAC-SHA256(seed[0:16], C[0:0xE0]) == C[0xE0:0x100]
+ *   frame MAC= HMAC-SHA256(frame key, C[::-1] || BE(nonce,counter,addr,...))
+ *
+ * The pair this file used to hold (block 2) was captured on the SPARE in
+ * session 20; the keys are per-unit (report 174), so it can never verify on
+ * the reference and was replaced in session 27.
