+config CM3217
+	depends on I2C
+	tristate "CM3217 driver (PlayBook)"
+	help
+	  Say Y here for the Capella CM3217 ambient light sensor as wired on
+	  the BlackBerry PlayBook.  Unlike cm32181 this part has no register
+	  file: the ALS count is split across two slave addresses (0x10 MSB
+	  and command, 0x11 LSB and configuration) and is read with bare
+	  one-byte transfers.  Protocol from RIM's ls-cm3217.so, report 181.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
+	  be called cm3217.
+
 config CM3232
 	depends on I2C
 	tristate "CM3232 ambient light sensor"
